WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
I have some clothes to save. I have a lot of clothes savers in my family.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,220
You have as much as you want

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,220
I can pack a lot of clothes at home

4
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:09,180
Could you please help me move something?

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,900
Wait a moment

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,300
I still have some rescue clothes here

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,500
I'll do it all for you

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,700
Is it okay to wear any clothes?

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,500
If it is winter, the clothes will be better

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,700
Yes, I have a lot of clothes here

11
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,700
I don’t even know how old some of the clothes are.

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:34,030
Just wait. I'll get it for you soon. Is it enough?

13
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:46,540
Enough, of course, that's enough. Thank you, sister. No need to thank you. Go back, General Liu Sanxiao.

14
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,340
Oh my God, so much stuff.

15
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,540
Each other, where is Liu San?

16
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,540
The third brother went to be single

17
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:52,340
I took another person with me on an iron horse.

18
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,540
See if anyone else is coming

19
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:54,740
Go and call Mr. Fan over

20
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,980
So many clothes, all clothes

21
00:00:57,980 --> 00:00:59,180
Yes, it's all clothes
